# reach's active monitor layout is a symlink into de/.config/reach/monitors/,
# and which one it points at is per-machine state — the same reason
# ~/.local/state/quickshell/features.json lives outside the repo. The layouts
# themselves are committed; only the choice is not.
de/.config/reach/monitors.zon
